1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,876
Speaking, task four. Situation number 1. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:20,272
Our friend has a birthday soon. We want to buy her a present together. What shall we buy her? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:28,967 --> 00:00:30,538
We can buy her a book.

4
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:33,340
I think she already has the book. She doesn't read much.

5
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:35,326
Then let's buy her chocolate.

6
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:38,134
Not chocolate, she doesn't eat sweets now.

7
00:00:38,433 --> 00:00:41,069
OK, then let's buy her flowers.

8
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:42,973
And why do you want to buy that?

9
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:45,800
Because she likes flowers and they will make her happy.

10
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,697
That's true, flowers are a good idea. Let's buy her flowers.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,321
Practise situation 1 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
